  <policy-marker code="7" significance="2" vocabulary="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s primary objective is aligned with addressing the vulnerabilities and impacts of climate change, particularly floods. It seeks to mitigate the immediate life-threatening impacts of flooding, fulfill basic humanitarian needs and make the affected communities aware of their entitlements and rights in such emergency situations.</narrative>
  </policy-marker>
